<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8210] Rebalancing sometimes is not triggered when a node is added to the baseline topology</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8210</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When a cluster already has baseline topology set and activated adding a new node to the baseline should lead to rebalancing. However, in some cases the new node will not receive any data when joined and added to the baseline; if a cluster is later deactivated and activated again, the rebalancing happens properly and partitions are assigned and transferred to the new node.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13151442">IGNITE-8210</key>
